      "motion_no": 1,
      "section": "",
      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "Commissioner Kemp made a motion to recommend approval of Item 1 Boulder Creek Commons now called River Crossing located at the corner of 1450 South and River Road with the following conditions: 1. The access to the parking field between buildings G and H on the landscape plan be reduced from 2 to 1 and that the applicant agreed to put in as a private drive access the access that is located south of future building H for use as a full access until such time as the second phase is developed. Amended to include they work with staff to illustrate in each drive through area how many cars will stack and if there is a way to create as much stack as possible without clogging up the drive aisles.",
      "motion_type": "Land-Use/Zoning",
      "result": "Positive recommendation 6:0",
      "mover": "Steve Kemp",
      "seconder": "Elise West",
      "aye": [
        "Ray Draper",
        "Steve Kemp",
        "Emily Andrus",
