      "body": "PlanningCommission",
      "motion": "Commissioner Andrus made a motion to recommend approval to the City Council this request to change the zoning from open space, PD-C, C-2 and R-3 to PD-MU to allow for the development of this new mixed use project Tech Ridge with the following conditions: 1. They must return to planning commission to request 25% shared parking at the time of the PD amendment and site plan 2. That any parking that is not on the same lot as the building that it must be adjacent to the building if it’s going to be considered part of the parking 3. The revision that was recommended by staff about the on-street parking be included as written in the staff packet. 4. That the temporary structures comply with all the City safety codes and that they be approved by staff.",
      "motion_type": "Land-Use/Zoning",
      "result": "Positive recommendation 5:0",
